function sourcePalette(source){const medium={Film:'#287cff',Serial:'#8657e8',Komiks:'#ef3f4f',Książka:'#e0a51c',Gra:'#13b977',Inne:'#27aeb7'},tag={EMCU:'#df3348',MVO:'#35b84a'},tags=sourceTags(source),tagColor=tags.includes('EMCU')?tag.EMCU:tags.includes('MVO')?tag.MVO:'#2bc5a2',colors=sourceColorMode==='tag'?[tagColor]:[medium[source.type]||medium.Inne],strength=source.status==='Ukończone'||source.status==='Opracowane'?62:source.status==='Rozpoczęte'?40:18,mixes=colors.map(color=>`color-mix(in srgb,${color} ${strength}%,var(--panel2))`);return `--source-bg:${mixes[0]};--source-accent:${colors[0]||'#27aeb7'}`}
function sourceRow(source){const worlds=sourceWorldLabels(source),links=relatedSources(source),relation=sourceRelationLabel(source.relationType);return `<article class="list-item source-item" style="${sourcePalette(source)}"><span class="list-mark">▤</span><div class="list-copy"><b>${escapeHtml(source.title)}</b><small>${escapeHtml(source.type)} · akcja: ${dateLabel(source.date,source.dateApprox)} · ${releaseLabel(source.releaseDate)}</small>${links.length?`<small class="source-relation-line">↳ ${escapeHtml(relation||'powiązane')} z: ${escapeHtml(links.map(item=>item.title).join(' · '))}</small>`:''}<div class="tag-row">${sourceTagMarkup(source)}${relation?`<span class="tag movie-comic-tag">${escapeHtml(relation)}</span>`:''}${source.canonStatus?`<span class="tag canon-tag">${escapeHtml(source.canonStatus)}</span>`:''}${worlds.map(world=>`<span class="tag">${escapeHtml(world)}</span>`).join('')}</div></div><span class="status">${escapeHtml(source.status)}</span><div class="source-actions"><button class="add-event-from-source mini-button" data-id="${source.id}" type="button" title="Dodaj wydarzenie z tego źródła" aria-label="Dodaj wydarzenie z tego źródła">＋●</button>${itemActions('source',source.id)}</div></article>`}
function allSourceTags(){return [...new Set((activeProject()?.sources||[]).flatMap(sourceTags))].sort()}
function filteredSources(){const sources=activeProject()?.sources||[];return sourceTagFilter==='all'?sources:sources.filter(source=>sourceTags(source).includes(sourceTagFilter))}
function sourceControls(){const tags=allSourceTags();return `<div class="source-controls"><div class="source-tag-filters"><button class="${sourceTagFilter==='all'?'active':''}" data-source-tag="all" type="button">Wszystkie</button>${tags.map(tag=>`<button class="${sourceTagFilter===tag?'active':''}" data-source-tag="${escapeHtml(tag)}" type="button">#${escapeHtml(tag)}</button>`).join('')}</div><label>Kolor tła<select data-source-color><option value="medium" ${sourceColorMode==='medium'?'selected':''}>według medium</option><option value="tag" ${sourceColorMode==='tag'?'selected':''}>według hashtagu</option></select></label></div>`}
function bindSourceControls(root=document){root.querySelectorAll('[data-source-tag]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{sourceTagFilter=button.dataset.sourceTag;sourcePage=0;renderSources();renderRoad()}));root.querySelectorAll('[data-source-color]').forEach(select=>select.addEventListener('change',()=>{sourceColorMode=select.value;renderSources();renderRoad()}))}
function eventSourceIds(event){return [...new Set([event.sourceId,...(event.sourceIds||[])].filter(Boolean))]}
function eventRelations(event){if(Array.isArray(event.relations))return event.relations.filter(relation=>RELATION_TYPES.has(relation.type)&&relation.eventId);return RELATION_TYPES.has(event.timeType)&&event.relationEventId?[{type:event.timeType,eventId:event.relationEventId}]:[]}
function eventSources(event){const ids=eventSourceIds(event);return (activeProject()?.sources||[]).filter(source=>ids.includes(source.id))}
function chronologyKey(value=''){const text=String(value).trim(),normalized=text.replace(/,/g,'');if(!text)return Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY;if(/^(beginning of time|początek czasu)$/i.test(text))return Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY;let match=normalized.match(/^(-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)\s*(BC|BCE|p\.n\.e\.)$/i);if(match)return-Number(match[1]);match=normalized.match(/^(-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)\s*(AD|CE|n\.e\.)?$/i);if(match)return Number(match[1]);match=text.match(/^(-?\d{1,6})-(\d{2})-(\d{2})$/);if(match)return Number(match[1])+Number(match[2])/12+Number(match[3])/372;return Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY}
function sourceSheetRow(source){const rows=source.sheetRows||{},preferred=sourceTagFilter!=='all'?rows[sourceTagFilter]:rows.MVO??rows.EMCU;if(Number.isFinite(Number(preferred)))return Number(preferred);const positions=[source.importKey,...(source.importKeys||[])].map(importSheetPosition).filter(Boolean),match=sourceTagFilter==='all'?positions.find(position=>position.tag==='MVO')||positions.find(position=>position.tag==='EMCU'):positions.find(position=>position.tag===sourceTagFilter);return match?.row??Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY}
function chronologicalCompare(a,b){const difference=chronologyKey(a.date)-chronologyKey(b.date);if(!Number.isNaN(difference)&&difference!==0)return difference;const sheetDifference=sourceSheetRow(a)-sourceSheetRow(b);return !Number.isNaN(sheetDifference)&&sheetDifference!==0?sheetDifference:(a.createdAt||'').localeCompare(b.createdAt||'')}
function sourceCatalogCompare(a,b){if(sourceTagFilter==='all'||sourceTagFilter==='MVO'){const sheetDifference=sourceSheetRow(a)-sourceSheetRow(b);if(!Number.isNaN(sheetDifference)&&sheetDifference!==0)return sheetDifference}return chronologicalCompare(a,b)}
function matchesViewSearch(view,values){const query=metadataKey(viewSearch[view]);return !query||metadataKey(values.filter(Boolean).join(' ')).includes(query)}
function sourceMatchesSearch(source,view){return matchesViewSearch(view,[source.title,source.type,source.status,source.date,source.releaseDate,sourceRelationLabel(source.relationType),source.canonStatus,...sourceTags(source),...sourceWorldLabels(source),...relatedSources(source).map(item=>item.title)])}
function eventMatchesSearch(event,view){return matchesViewSearch(view,[relationHaystack(event),event.date,event.timeType,...eventRelations(event).map(relation=>relation.type)])}
function characterMatchesSearch(character){return matchesViewSearch('characters',[character.name,...characterAliases(character),character.world,character.birthDate,character.deathDate])}
function earliestDate(values){return values.filter(Boolean).sort((a,b)=>chronologyKey(a)-chronologyKey(b))[0]||''}
